OL,3,GNEWSATwinning plan with Iraqi city
OL,4,Aproposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK council's plan to form a
OL,7,Ffriendship link with an Iraqi city to
OL,8,Fhonour a figure who saved British
OL,9,Fsoldiers during and after World War One
OL,10,Fis due to be discussed.
OL,12,FPortsmouth City Council will
OL,13,Finvestigate forming the bond with
OL,14,FHalabja, a Kurdish city in
OL,15,Fnorth-eastern Iraq.
OL,17,FThe idea was first proposed in 2019 by
OL,18,FKurdish Home, a Portsmouth-based
OL,19,Fsupport organisation representing the
OL,20,Fcity's Kurdish community, but progress
OL,21,Fwas halted by the Covid-19 pandemic.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
