OL,3,GNEWSATwinning plan with Iraqi city
OL,4,Aproposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the link would honour Lady
OL,7,FAdela, a Kurdish noblewoman of the Jaff
OL,8,Ftribe, which ruled the Halabja region
OL,9,Fin the late 19th and early 20th
OL,10,FCenturies.
